 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Sun, 23 Aug 2026 12:47:28 -0500

homelab-borg-service-backup-client (0.2.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * BREAKING: renamed the CLI binary from 'homelab-borgbackup' to
    'homelab-borg-service-backup-client' (matching the package name,
    same convention as the server package), along with its systemd
    unit names, syslog identifier, and man page. Update any scripts,
    cron jobs, or muscle memory referencing the old name. No compat
    symlink is provided (no production host has this client configured
    yet). Also fixed tests/conftest.py's broken cross-repo import path
    left over from the client/server package split.

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Sun, 23 Aug 2026 09:30:00 -0500

